.claude
# .claude stays the developer's OWN local dir (settings.local.json, personal
# skills). The repo's skills live in .agents/skills and are linked into it —
# see the README. Version those; ignore everything else under .agents.
/.agents/*
!/.agents/skills
package-lock.json
node_modules
/sema.*
sema-bench.*
cache
:memory:
backup
analyze_training.ts
sema-article
bench/*
!bench/README.md
!bench/sema-vs-gemma.mjs
tsconfig.analyze.json
FINDINGS.md
RESIDUALS.md
dist/

# the research store: the demo data copied here (sema.sqlite + the two vec indexes)
data/

# run artifacts, and the owner's own `Sema — …` notes: never part of the library
*.log
Sema*

roteiro-pesquisa.md
demo-artefatos
violacoes.md
criterios-remocao.md
